# CSS Modules naming

- Always name style modules in **lowercase**: `header.module.scss`, `language.module.scss`
- Never use PascalCase for modules: ~~`Header.module.scss`~~
- Import with the same lowercase path:

```ts
import css from '@/widgets/header/ui/header.module.scss';
```

On Windows the filesystem is case-insensitive, so the editor may show the wrong casing. Prefer the lowercase path when opening or renaming files.
